WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 9=

01:55.760 --> 01:56.310
Your Highness!

01:57.200 --> 01:58.209
When you went to Sigui Garden,

01:58.251 --> 01:59.171
didn't you take me with you?

01:59.950 --> 02:01.760
How could you leave without a word
and forget all about me?

02:02.280 --> 02:03.150
And Fang Tong!

02:03.510 --> 02:05.040
He just drove the carriage away
without a word.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.510
I was scared out of my wits!

02:12.030 --> 02:13.680
If Liu Wenji hadn't been there...

02:15.750 --> 02:16.680
Exactly.

02:17.310 --> 02:18.590
You had Liu Wenji with you.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.590
If I'd called you away,

02:20.960 --> 02:22.310
I'd have interrupted
a pair of lovebirds.

02:24.150 --> 02:25.070
Oh, come on!

02:25.710 --> 02:26.710
Your Highness, don't tease me.

02:29.190 --> 02:30.150
Go scold Fang Tong instead.

02:30.840 --> 02:31.750
I want some peace and quiet.

02:40.750 --> 02:42.590
When I was young,

02:43.240 --> 02:45.150
I too was full of ambition.

02:45.960 --> 02:48.680
I vowed to serve a ruler who could
restore our nation's glory.

02:49.470 --> 02:50.680
Together, ruler and ministers

02:51.150 --> 02:52.960
would bring prosperity back to Huai,

02:54.030 --> 02:55.400
with nations coming from afar
to pay tribute,

02:55.630 --> 02:56.840
peace throughout the land,

02:57.280 --> 02:58.750
and happiness for the people.

03:00.310 --> 03:02.280
But then came the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

03:02.630 --> 03:04.680
and the people suffered terribly.

03:06.030 --> 03:08.910
Years of the court's efforts
were destroyed overnight.

03:09.800 --> 03:11.000
Though the rebellion was quelled,

03:11.800 --> 03:12.430
military power

03:13.080 --> 03:15.520
fell into Yu Cheng'an's hands.

03:17.150 --> 03:20.280
The eunuch faction
became a swarm of leeches,

03:21.030 --> 03:22.590
feeding day and night

03:23.520 --> 03:25.030
on the lifeblood of Huai.

03:28.750 --> 03:29.910
Our great cause remains unfinished.

03:30.590 --> 03:31.800
All our efforts have come to nothing.

03:32.710 --> 03:33.910
Yet His Majesty and I

03:34.470 --> 03:36.120
have both grown old.

03:36.680 --> 03:37.590
At court,

03:38.630 --> 03:40.710
everyone has their own agenda.

03:41.870 --> 03:44.190
They'll stop at nothing to seize power.

03:44.840 --> 03:47.870
Yet no one cares
about the common people.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.430
I concede defeat.

04:22.510 --> 04:23.630
You're still young.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.750
There's no shame in losing a few games.

04:26.560 --> 04:27.000
In time,

04:27.480 --> 04:28.720
you'll have plenty of room to improve.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.120
Thank you, sir.

04:30.680 --> 04:31.979
Don't thank me just yet.

04:32.021 --> 04:33.621
I'm the one asking you for a favor.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.040
Yan Shang,

04:36.800 --> 04:39.510
our nation is now ruled by traitors.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.070
Inside and outside the court,

04:41.160 --> 04:44.750
it's full of beasts masquerading
as honorable men.

04:46.160 --> 04:46.920
Have you considered this?

04:47.870 --> 04:49.720
If you leave Sheng'an today,

04:49.950 --> 04:52.680
the same tragedies will happen again,

04:53.120 --> 04:54.750
over and over, countless times.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.120
Yan Shang,

04:57.270 --> 04:59.040
is that really what you want?

05:04.000 --> 05:04.390
No.

05:11.040 --> 05:11.510
Look.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.630
This is the gate of Sheng'an.

05:15.270 --> 05:16.430
Towering and imposing,

05:17.310 --> 05:18.160
yet when an army is defeated,

05:19.360 --> 05:20.680
it is as flimsy as paper.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.310
Beyond the gate,

05:23.720 --> 05:24.830
a broad avenue stretches straight ahead.

05:25.360 --> 05:28.160
The people live along its sides,
and Taiji Palace stands at its end.

05:28.800 --> 05:31.360
This is the heart of Huai.

05:31.680 --> 05:35.310
Nowhere else can one influence
the fate of the realm

05:35.750 --> 05:37.390
and shape the course of history
like here.

05:41.240 --> 05:41.870
Yan Shang,

05:43.240 --> 05:44.680
you have extraordinary courage.

05:45.390 --> 05:47.390
Enough to commit murder in Sheng'an,

05:48.190 --> 05:50.920
right under the Emperor's nose.

05:52.360 --> 05:53.360
And you're remarkably patient,

05:54.560 --> 05:57.480
able to lie low and scheme
without betraying a thing.

05:58.390 --> 06:00.240
So do you dare to stay

06:00.630 --> 06:03.800
and right the injustices of this world
with your own hands?

06:27.870 --> 06:28.800
Chancellor Liu,

06:30.480 --> 06:31.600
what should I do?

06:36.270 --> 06:36.950
Stay.

06:37.920 --> 06:38.870
Rise through the ranks.

06:39.510 --> 06:42.070
Until you hold the power to decide
who lives and dies,

06:42.680 --> 06:44.430
and determine the fate of Huai.

06:45.560 --> 06:46.070
Yan Shang,

06:46.830 --> 06:49.830
this road is long and treacherous.

06:50.830 --> 06:53.430
It may cost you your entire life,

06:53.870 --> 06:55.830
or even get you killed.

06:56.310 --> 06:58.040
Once you set foot on this path,

06:59.270 --> 07:00.190
no one will help you.

07:00.560 --> 07:02.750
You must rely on your own abilities

07:03.480 --> 07:06.000
to accomplish everything you aspire to.

07:06.360 --> 07:06.920
Succeed,

07:07.680 --> 07:09.750
and you'll destroy the traitors
and bring peace to the realm.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.120
Fail,

07:11.560 --> 07:13.920
and you won't even have a grave
to call your own.

07:21.310 --> 07:21.870
Well then.

07:22.870 --> 07:24.120
Our game is finished,

07:24.630 --> 07:26.160
and I've said all I have to say.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.630
Once you've decided which path to take,

07:29.510 --> 07:30.040
just go.

07:44.160 --> 07:45.070
Thank you, Chancellor.

07:47.060 --> 07:50.300
(Donghui Pavilion)

08:28.830 --> 08:30.040
(If my timing is right,)

08:31.430 --> 08:32.870
(he should be out of the city by now.)

08:37.270 --> 08:38.030
Your Highness! Your Highness!

08:39.670 --> 08:40.200
Your Highness.

08:40.510 --> 08:41.489
What is it now?

08:41.531 --> 08:42.691
Your Highness, Yan Shang is here.

09:08.150 --> 09:08.870
Greetings, Your Highness.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.720
I thought you'd left.

09:14.550 --> 09:15.360
Why have you come back?

09:17.600 --> 09:18.670
Couldn't walk any farther?

09:19.240 --> 09:20.270
Come to borrow my carriage?

09:23.080 --> 09:24.030
I won't need a carriage just yet.

09:24.870 --> 09:26.390
But could I trouble you
for some hot water?

09:26.910 --> 09:27.790
I'd like to bathe and change

09:28.440 --> 09:29.550
before explaining myself.

09:32.270 --> 09:32.720
Chunhua.

09:33.320 --> 09:34.080
Take him to get cleaned up.

09:41.200 --> 09:41.630
Shang,

09:42.240 --> 09:43.550
did you quarrel with Her Highness again?

09:44.440 --> 09:45.030
I wouldn't dare.

09:45.600 --> 09:46.440
I'll show you to the bathhouse.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.080
Will you need a change of clothes?

09:51.910 --> 09:52.670
I'm afraid so.

10:31.240 --> 10:31.750
Your Highness.

10:33.240 --> 10:33.720
Your Highness.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.080
Why are you hiding?

10:37.720 --> 10:38.200
Your Highness.

10:39.320 --> 10:40.030
What is it you need?

10:41.360 --> 10:42.870
I'm here to bring you some clothes.

10:44.750 --> 10:45.120
Well,

10:45.870 --> 10:47.270
thank you very much, then.

10:49.440 --> 10:51.120
Yan Shang, you're a strange one.

10:51.750 --> 10:53.360
You dare kill someone right
in front of me,

10:53.550 --> 10:55.000
but you're afraid to bathe
in front of me?

10:55.390 --> 10:56.910
Please give me a moment of privacy,
Your Highness,

10:57.750 --> 10:58.480
so I can get dressed.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.360
Yan Shang,

11:16.750 --> 11:17.960
how did you dare go through with it?

11:19.240 --> 11:20.600
There were so many people
at the festival today.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.510
One wrong move,

11:23.120 --> 11:24.120
and Zhang Renjing would've survived.

11:25.240 --> 11:25.630
Your Highness,

11:26.630 --> 11:29.240
no plan in this world
is completely foolproof.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.720
Once I'd decided he had to die,

11:32.550 --> 11:34.440
even if he'd escaped this time,

11:35.440 --> 11:36.320
there would be another chance,

11:36.960 --> 11:37.790
and another after that.

11:41.840 --> 11:42.750
As long as I'm alive,

11:44.000 --> 11:45.120
as long as I remain in Sheng'an,

11:46.240 --> 11:47.120
sooner or later,

11:48.270 --> 11:49.440
he'll die by my hand.

11:52.080 --> 11:54.080
When I brought you here from Lingnan,

11:54.790 --> 11:55.550
I had no idea

11:55.910 --> 11:57.030
you'd turn out to be

11:57.360 --> 11:59.480
such a vicious beast that never
lets go of its prey.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.550
Are you afraid of me, Your Highness?

12:02.200 --> 12:03.000
If I were afraid of you,

12:03.790 --> 12:04.529
you'd already be

12:04.571 --> 12:06.141
locked up in the Court
of Judicial Review's prison.

12:07.440 --> 12:08.000
Now tell me,

12:08.600 --> 12:09.510
why did you come back?

12:12.550 --> 12:13.150
I came back

12:13.630 --> 12:15.120
to take the imperial exams
and enter official service.

12:15.840 --> 12:16.840
I ask for your support, Your Highness.

12:19.150 --> 12:21.080
Did you hit your head outside the city

12:21.550 --> 12:22.440
and suddenly come to your senses?

12:24.440 --> 12:25.120
You could say that.

12:35.440 --> 12:36.720
Why should I help you?

12:40.120 --> 12:40.840
I could

12:42.600 --> 12:44.240
tell you stories every night.

12:48.150 --> 12:48.720
Shang.

12:49.030 --> 12:50.390
You've got skin thicker

12:51.480 --> 12:53.200
than the walls of Sheng'an.

12:54.960 --> 12:55.960
I'm not short of company,

12:56.720 --> 12:57.720
nor am I afraid of nightmares.

12:59.120 --> 12:59.910
If that's all you have to offer,

13:01.270 --> 13:02.320
you won't be staying.

13:05.600 --> 13:07.630
I'm willing to fight the tiger
alongside you.

13:12.960 --> 13:13.510
What did you say?

13:14.910 --> 13:16.150
The person you seek revenge against...

13:17.000 --> 13:17.720
Is it Yu Cheng'an,

13:18.480 --> 13:19.360
or someone else?

13:22.360 --> 13:23.720
I'm willing to stand by your side,

13:24.440 --> 13:25.320
serve as your adviser,

13:25.600 --> 13:26.360
and become your right-hand man.

13:28.360 --> 13:30.000
Together, we'll bring down those
who deserve it.

13:33.440 --> 13:38.230
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

13:43.200 --> 13:44.150
Have you thought this through?

13:46.880 --> 13:52.470
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

13:58.150 --> 13:58.720
This time,

14:00.550 --> 14:02.000
I won't give you a chance
to change your mind.

14:02.720 --> 14:03.270
This time,

14:04.840 --> 14:06.030
I'm not leaving.

14:08.440 --> 14:08.840
Yan Shang.

14:10.360 --> 14:11.000
I accept your offer.

14:11.960 --> 14:13.240
Do you know what I see in you?

14:15.750 --> 14:16.360
You have patience

14:16.910 --> 14:17.390
and ruthlessness.

14:19.360 --> 14:21.240
There are so many people I want dead.

14:22.240 --> 14:22.550
You

14:23.630 --> 14:24.720
will make a valuable ally.

14:27.510 --> 14:29.709
♪Not a single hour less♪

14:30.460 --> 14:36.900
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

14:37.190 --> 14:40.630
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

14:40.830 --> 14:44.299
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

14:44.540 --> 14:51.380
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

14:51.560 --> 14:53.199
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

14:53.241 --> 14:56.020
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

14:56.036 --> 14:58.496
♪You're the only one I need♪

14:59.870 --> 15:00.240
Yan Shang.

15:02.080 --> 15:02.750
Today, you and I

15:03.600 --> 15:04.360
shall seal our pact by biting our arms.

15:06.240 --> 15:07.120
From this day forward,

15:08.080 --> 15:09.000
we stand or fall together,

15:10.030 --> 15:11.030
bound together in life and death.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.480
We seal our pact in blood,

15:30.630 --> 15:31.960
bound together in life and death.

15:31.960 --> 15:36.340
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

15:37.940 --> 15:40.340
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

15:41.000 --> 15:42.000
You really bit hard!

15:53.150 --> 15:54.080
(Interrogation Chamber, Judicial Review)
Outside the private room,

15:55.030 --> 15:55.870
was he the only person you saw?

15:56.630 --> 15:57.150
Yes.

15:57.440 --> 15:58.510
I wouldn't dare hide anything.

15:59.320 --> 16:00.870
That young man told me
to fetch some wine,

16:01.150 --> 16:02.030
so I went.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.240
When I returned,

16:03.840 --> 16:05.120
he... he'd already disappeared.

16:05.840 --> 16:06.480
And what

16:07.240 --> 16:07.870
did he look like?

16:08.600 --> 16:09.670
He was a young man,

16:10.150 --> 16:11.320
dressed in a white robe.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.240
I embroidered this.

16:24.240 --> 16:24.600
What do you think?

16:28.240 --> 16:29.200
Take a closer look.

16:37.440 --> 16:38.510
This waterweed...

16:39.720 --> 16:40.360
Sharp eyes.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.320
Do you know who these fish represent?

16:44.150 --> 16:45.150
Please enlighten me, Your Highness.

16:47.550 --> 16:48.440
The little one

16:48.910 --> 16:49.630
is Yu Xianyao,

16:50.120 --> 16:51.150
Yu Cheng'an's adopted son.

16:52.720 --> 16:54.840
(Yao)
He terrorizes Sheng'an,

16:55.200 --> 16:55.750
committing every crime imaginable.

16:56.840 --> 16:58.360
(That's it! Hit him!)

16:58.360 --> 16:59.080
(Yu Xianyao, Yu Cheng'an's Adopted Son)

16:59.080 --> 17:01.080
The one below is Zheng Xing,
a senior palace attendant.

17:01.720 --> 17:02.910
But he doesn't serve the Emperor.

17:03.270 --> 17:03.960
He serves Yu Cheng'an.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.480
He's Yu Cheng'an's shadow
inside the palace.

17:07.160 --> 17:09.270
He does all of Yu Cheng'an's dirty work.

17:13.540 --> 17:15.030
(Zheng Xing, Senior Palace Attendant)

17:15.030 --> 17:15.880
(Zheng Xing, Senior Palace Attendant)
The one on the right

17:16.200 --> 17:18.240
is Qiu Shuo, General of Tiger Might
in the Shence Army.

17:19.000 --> 17:20.160
When it comes to ferocity and courage,

17:20.590 --> 17:21.750
no one at court can match him.

17:22.720 --> 17:24.000
What a shame that
such a formidable general

17:24.270 --> 17:25.680
has become Yu Cheng'an's guard dog.

17:26.960 --> 17:28.720
Whenever Yu Cheng'an goes out,

17:29.310 --> 17:31.070
Qiu Shuo personally leads
the Shence Army to guard him.

17:31.750 --> 17:33.030
So to kill Yu Cheng'an,

17:33.510 --> 17:34.680
(Qiu Shuo, General, Shence Army)
Qiu Shuo must die first.

17:35.640 --> 17:37.350
The one at the top is Wei Qiao.

17:38.110 --> 17:39.240
He holds no official degree,

17:39.720 --> 17:41.510
yet he's Yu Cheng'an's
most trusted adviser.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.640
He's known as the Jade-Faced Fox,

17:44.400 --> 17:44.920
Wei Zidu.

17:46.820 --> 17:50.060
(Wei Qiao, Adviser to Yu Cheng'an)

17:55.720 --> 17:56.480
Wei Qiao...

17:57.640 --> 17:58.590
How is he related to Wei Shu?

17:58.920 --> 17:59.640
He's his older cousin.

18:05.030 --> 18:06.200
Then the biggest fish

18:06.640 --> 18:07.920
must be Yu Cheng'an himself.

18:21.680 --> 18:22.590
There certainly are

18:23.000 --> 18:23.790
a lot of people you want dead.

18:27.480 --> 18:28.590
If you're having second thoughts,

18:29.110 --> 18:29.590
it's too late.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.590
I'd have to kill you to keep you quiet.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.270
If you fear the weight
of all this bloodshed,

18:36.350 --> 18:37.640
recite a few more sutras.

18:39.750 --> 18:41.030
No sacred scripture
can save either of us.

18:41.790 --> 18:42.830
If a hell of blood awaits us,

18:43.750 --> 18:44.400
I'll descend into it with you.

18:49.270 --> 18:49.680
Your Highness,

18:51.200 --> 18:52.200
may I ask you something?

18:53.110 --> 18:54.720
If you think it'll make me angry,

18:55.070 --> 18:55.680
don't bother.

18:57.160 --> 18:58.550
Why do you trust me, Your Highness?

19:01.000 --> 19:01.480
Yan Shang,

19:01.880 --> 19:02.640
you're mistaken.

19:03.590 --> 19:04.830
I swore an oath of allegiance with you

19:05.110 --> 19:06.110
and explained this embroidery to you

19:07.160 --> 19:08.590
only because we can be useful
to each other.

19:08.920 --> 19:09.680
It makes us suitable allies.

19:11.400 --> 19:13.590
Besides, you're a murderer now.

19:14.510 --> 19:16.160
Where else can you go

19:16.350 --> 19:17.200
but stay right here by my side?

19:18.790 --> 19:19.550
So,

19:20.270 --> 19:21.310
I don't trust you,

19:22.270 --> 19:23.200
and you needn't trust me either.

19:23.790 --> 19:24.920
If one day,

19:25.480 --> 19:26.350
we're both still alive

19:26.550 --> 19:28.030
and have accomplished everything
we set out to do,

19:28.920 --> 19:29.480
then

19:30.680 --> 19:31.680
we can part on good terms.

19:36.750 --> 19:38.160
But for now,

19:39.030 --> 19:40.680
we're allies in the same boat.

19:41.750 --> 19:42.720
Sheng'an is full of prying eyes.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.830
I need to give you an official place
in my household,

19:47.640 --> 19:48.960
so you can stay by my side

19:49.640 --> 19:50.510
without arousing suspicion.

19:54.880 --> 19:55.830
An official place?

19:59.920 --> 20:00.510
From now on,

20:01.110 --> 20:02.920
you'll officially be my male favorite.

20:03.960 --> 20:04.880
If you're too thin-skinned

20:05.270 --> 20:06.880
to endure the gossip
whenever you come and go,

20:07.720 --> 20:08.590
you might as well quit now.

20:14.160 --> 20:15.550
I'm honored by your favor,
Your Highness.

20:17.240 --> 20:17.960
Of course.

20:26.820 --> 20:29.220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

20:29.680 --> 20:30.249
Wenji, what's wrong?

20:30.291 --> 20:30.661
Chunhua.

20:33.920 --> 20:34.200
Come here.

20:38.270 --> 20:39.200
Is Yan Shang here?

20:40.000 --> 20:40.350
Yes.

20:40.830 --> 20:41.510
Are you looking for him?

20:41.790 --> 20:42.400
I'll go get him.

20:43.920 --> 20:44.440
Thank goodness.

20:44.790 --> 20:45.920
He was right to come here.

20:47.720 --> 20:49.350
A group of officers from the Court
of Judicial Review

20:49.640 --> 20:51.200
just burst into the place
Yan Shang and I share

20:51.510 --> 20:52.550
and searched it from top to bottom.

20:53.400 --> 20:55.590
They said they wanted to take him in
for questioning.

20:56.350 --> 20:57.790
I rushed to the Imperial Academy
to find him,

20:58.240 --> 20:59.110
but he wasn't there.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.440
The only other place I could think of

21:01.030 --> 21:02.000
was the princess's residence.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.590
What does the Court want with Yan Shang?

21:06.030 --> 21:06.920
I have no idea.

21:08.030 --> 21:09.590
Could you please let him know?

21:10.790 --> 21:11.350
Don't worry.

21:11.680 --> 21:12.590
I'll tell him right away.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.440
Officers have already searched
Yongshou Temple.

21:19.830 --> 21:21.160
They're searching everywhere
for Yan Shang.

21:23.590 --> 21:25.590
Did they say who ordered his arrest?

21:26.920 --> 21:27.350
No.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.440
Send Fang Tong to the Court
of Judicial Review.

21:32.830 --> 21:33.350
Tell him to find Yang Si

21:34.200 --> 21:35.400
and have him come see me here.

21:47.480 --> 21:48.400
Thank goodness you're safe.

21:48.790 --> 21:49.859
The murderer hadn't been caught,

21:49.901 --> 21:50.661
and you'd disappeared.

21:51.680 --> 21:52.590
Only later did I hear

21:52.790 --> 21:53.830
you'd taken a carriage home.

21:54.550 --> 21:55.110
Murderer?

21:56.480 --> 21:57.160
What murderer?

21:58.720 --> 21:59.880
The one who stabbed Zhang Renjing
to death.

22:00.510 --> 22:01.750
Wasn't it Grand Princess Luling?

22:02.550 --> 22:03.000
No.

22:04.000 --> 22:04.960
Luling only stabbed him once.

22:05.590 --> 22:07.310
Someone else inflicted
the fatal wounds afterward.

22:08.480 --> 22:09.270
I suspect...

22:09.830 --> 22:10.510
I was the one who stabbed him.

22:12.790 --> 22:13.160
What?

22:13.960 --> 22:15.350
I'm the one who stabbed
that brute to death.

22:15.790 --> 22:16.960
Are you taking me to the authorities?

22:23.510 --> 22:24.350
Oh, I almost forgot.

22:25.350 --> 22:26.110
You are the authorities.

22:28.310 --> 22:30.270
Wanyao, this is no joking matter!

22:30.750 --> 22:31.680
A man's life is at stake.

22:46.640 --> 22:47.590
This is the knife that killed him.

22:53.790 --> 22:54.720
Why do you have a knife?

22:55.440 --> 22:56.480
Where did you buy it?

22:57.200 --> 22:58.350
How would I know?

22:59.720 --> 23:00.790
Who said it was mine?

23:02.030 --> 23:03.000
It belonged to that brute.

23:03.830 --> 23:04.880
He pulled it from his sleeve

23:05.640 --> 23:06.640
and lunged straight at me.

23:07.270 --> 23:08.200
I managed to wrestle it from him

23:08.640 --> 23:09.200
and stabbed him to death.

23:09.960 --> 23:10.680
You encountered him?

23:11.000 --> 23:11.550
Of course I did.

23:16.310 --> 23:16.680
No.

23:18.200 --> 23:18.550
Wanyao,

23:18.960 --> 23:19.440
tell me,

23:20.240 --> 23:21.070
how exactly did you kill him?

23:21.550 --> 23:22.640
Where did you stab him? How many times?

23:24.030 --> 23:24.480
Yang Si.

23:25.680 --> 23:26.640
Why don't you just put me in chains

23:27.310 --> 23:28.440
and torture me at the Court
of Judicial Review?

23:29.310 --> 23:30.640
You rushed off in such a hurry.

23:31.590 --> 23:32.830
I was left hiding alone, terrified.

23:33.440 --> 23:34.830
Then that man suddenly lunged at me.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.880
I was lucky enough to fight back.

23:37.750 --> 23:39.200
How could I remember exactly
how I killed him?

23:40.160 --> 23:42.000
I don't even know what made that brute
so bold

23:42.510 --> 23:44.590
that he dared attack me
despite his injuries.

23:45.440 --> 23:48.030
The coroner found alcohol
and aphrodisiacs in his stomach.

23:50.240 --> 23:51.680
He was probably out of his mind.

23:57.750 --> 23:58.790
His body was covered in severe wounds.

23:59.400 --> 23:59.680
You...

24:03.240 --> 24:04.030
Where are your bloodstained clothes?

24:04.510 --> 24:05.720
Can you show them to me?

24:06.310 --> 24:06.790
I burned them.

24:07.590 --> 24:08.880
Why would I keep something so cursed?

24:16.270 --> 24:16.830
There's something else.

24:18.510 --> 24:19.070
Chunhua,

24:19.640 --> 24:21.400
fetch my cloak from the carriage.

24:36.590 --> 24:37.920
Why didn't you tell me?

24:38.070 --> 24:39.200
Because you were on official duty.

24:40.030 --> 24:41.160
You had criminals to catch!

24:42.720 --> 24:43.680
When I encountered that man,

24:44.070 --> 24:45.110
where were you?

24:46.030 --> 24:47.070
When my life was in danger,

24:47.680 --> 24:48.830
what else could I do but fight
for my life?

24:49.160 --> 24:50.590
Was I supposed to count
on you to save me?

24:53.790 --> 24:54.830
I was terrified

24:55.720 --> 24:56.720
and accidentally stabbed him to death.

24:57.270 --> 24:58.270
I didn't dare tell anyone

24:58.750 --> 25:00.000
and hurried into my carriage.

25:00.920 --> 25:01.830
Imagine the rumors
if people learned that

25:02.550 --> 25:04.680
the man who assaulted Grand Princess
Luling had come after me too.

25:05.160 --> 25:06.160
What would they say about me?

25:11.720 --> 25:12.400
But then again,

25:14.070 --> 25:15.750
I'm hardly a model of chastity.

25:17.830 --> 25:19.110
My reputation as a woman

25:19.880 --> 25:20.830
could hardly get any worse.

25:21.400 --> 25:22.329
No, that's not...

25:22.371 --> 25:23.021
Not what?

25:24.510 --> 25:25.750
Not a widow returned from a marriage
far away?

25:26.680 --> 25:27.200
Or

25:28.680 --> 25:29.960
not a murderer?

25:37.920 --> 25:38.510
Back then,

25:38.880 --> 25:40.200
I actually left you alone.

25:43.400 --> 25:43.790
Come on.

25:45.030 --> 25:45.769
Let's go to the Court
of Judicial Review together.

25:45.811 --> 25:46.181
No!

25:46.830 --> 25:47.240
Wanyao.

25:47.680 --> 25:48.680
I'll pretend I never came here today.

25:49.550 --> 25:51.030
Other than me,

25:51.400 --> 25:52.750
you mustn't tell another soul.

25:53.240 --> 25:53.880
Of course.

25:54.200 --> 25:55.160
I'm not a fool.

25:57.070 --> 25:57.790
That brute

25:58.160 --> 25:59.480
was a captain in the Shence Army,

26:00.550 --> 26:02.240
an old subordinate Yu Cheng'an
recently brought to the capital.

26:03.310 --> 26:05.550
I'm afraid the Shence Army
won't let this go.

26:06.480 --> 26:06.920
Don't worry.

26:07.270 --> 26:08.000
I'll find a way.

26:13.440 --> 26:14.790
So he was one of Yu Cheng'an's men.

26:18.000 --> 26:18.590
I have my own way.

26:19.160 --> 26:20.350
No need to trouble you, Assessor Yang.

26:21.510 --> 26:22.160
What way?

26:25.270 --> 26:25.920
I won't see you out.

27:07.480 --> 27:07.830
Your Highness.

27:19.680 --> 27:21.000
That childhood sweetheart of yours...

27:23.310 --> 27:25.030
You've only just become
my male favorite,

27:26.110 --> 27:27.200
and you're already jealous?

27:28.160 --> 27:28.790
Just now,

27:29.830 --> 27:30.550
when he saw me,

27:31.310 --> 27:32.750
he looked rather strange.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.030
He's now

27:35.830 --> 27:37.000
an assessor at the Court
of Judicial Review.

27:37.750 --> 27:38.920
He's investigating Zhang Renjing's
murder.

27:43.480 --> 27:44.480
Don't worry.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.550
You belong to me now.

27:47.110 --> 27:48.160
Of course I'll protect you.

27:49.160 --> 27:49.960
This matter

27:50.510 --> 27:51.480
is no longer your concern.

27:53.550 --> 27:54.400
Still, it's a murder case.

27:54.880 --> 27:55.510
For the next few days,

27:56.000 --> 27:56.920
don't leave the residence.

27:58.720 --> 28:00.310
If someone recognizes your face,

28:00.750 --> 28:02.680
they might remember something
that incriminates you.

28:03.640 --> 28:03.960
Also,

28:05.310 --> 28:06.920
tell me exactly what happened,

28:07.510 --> 28:10.440
from beginning to end.
Don't leave out a single detail.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.720
Then stay here.

28:13.920 --> 28:14.720
As for me,

28:16.070 --> 28:17.110
I have a relative to visit.

28:23.000 --> 28:24.440
By the time I came to my senses,

28:26.510 --> 28:28.510
the man was already lying on the ground,

28:29.680 --> 28:31.830
dead from my stab wounds.

28:33.270 --> 28:34.000
Aunt.

28:35.000 --> 28:36.000
Why must you and I

28:36.830 --> 28:39.200
suffer such terrible misfortunes?

28:40.640 --> 28:41.880
He wasn't just brazen.

28:42.790 --> 28:43.720
He must've been insane!

28:45.550 --> 28:47.400
I heard from the court officials

28:49.000 --> 28:50.790
that he'd taken a large dose
of aphrodisiacs

28:51.750 --> 28:53.550
and was terribly drunk.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.270
He'd lost his senses,

28:55.480 --> 28:57.440
which is why he stumbled
into the private room.

28:57.960 --> 28:58.510
Aunt,

28:59.030 --> 29:01.000
what if word of this gets out?

29:02.110 --> 29:03.400
So what if it does?

29:04.070 --> 29:05.310
You think I'm afraid of gossip?

29:06.310 --> 29:06.750
But...

29:08.070 --> 29:08.880
His wounds...

29:09.680 --> 29:11.510
We were the ones who stabbed him.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.400
After all,

29:14.440 --> 29:16.270
a man is dead!

29:17.590 --> 29:18.350
Aunt!

29:18.830 --> 29:21.790
I've never killed anyone before!

29:23.400 --> 29:24.440
There, there.

29:24.750 --> 29:26.440
That's enough, Wanyao.

29:27.030 --> 29:28.400
Stop crying.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.030
You're a princess.

29:31.640 --> 29:32.680
Have some dignity.

29:34.000 --> 29:35.830
I say you did well to kill him.

29:36.550 --> 29:37.550
In fact, I should thank you

29:37.920 --> 29:39.350
for avenging the insult I suffered.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.510
I only wish I'd been there.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.590
I'd have hacked him to pieces myself!

29:47.070 --> 29:48.440
Hearing you say that, Aunt,

29:49.160 --> 29:49.880
I suddenly

29:50.720 --> 29:52.200
feel so much better.

29:54.030 --> 29:56.270
Come to think of it, you and I

29:56.880 --> 29:58.510
have rid the people of a menace.

29:59.590 --> 30:00.920
Exactly.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.240
But...

30:09.960 --> 30:10.680
But...

30:11.350 --> 30:13.000
I heard from the court officials

30:14.160 --> 30:14.790
that the man

30:15.550 --> 30:17.240
was one of Lord Yu's subordinates.

30:18.830 --> 30:19.640
Aunt,

30:20.480 --> 30:22.270
won't that make things difficult?

30:23.720 --> 30:24.440
Wanyao,

30:25.510 --> 30:27.200
you really underestimate me.

30:27.790 --> 30:28.720
What's the big deal?

30:30.270 --> 30:31.200
So what if I killed

30:31.680 --> 30:33.070
a mere captain today?

30:33.480 --> 30:35.750
Even if I killed a general tomorrow,

30:36.750 --> 30:37.920
what of it?

30:46.680 --> 30:47.510
Wanyao claims

30:48.200 --> 30:49.240
she killed Zhang Renjing.

30:50.750 --> 30:51.200
Do you believe her?

30:53.680 --> 30:55.350
But she had the murder weapon
and bloodstained clothes.

30:56.270 --> 30:56.880
You don't believe her either,

30:57.830 --> 30:58.160
do you?

30:59.350 --> 31:00.480
No matter how reckless
Zhang Renjing was,

31:01.030 --> 31:01.920
or how drunk and drugged he was,

31:02.680 --> 31:03.550
he was still a seasoned soldier

31:03.960 --> 31:05.440
who'd survived years of fighting.

31:06.310 --> 31:07.480
He slept with one eye open.

31:08.790 --> 31:09.960
He was wounded and fleeing for his life.

31:10.550 --> 31:11.489
I refuse to believe he'd be

31:11.531 --> 31:13.331
so blinded by lust that he'd act
so recklessly.

31:14.440 --> 31:15.070
And Wanyao

31:15.790 --> 31:16.920
isn't someone who would commit murder.

31:18.640 --> 31:19.510
It's not that she lacks courage.

31:20.270 --> 31:21.480
But murder is a serious matter,

31:22.160 --> 31:23.240
and she'd never willingly

31:23.790 --> 31:25.030
get herself tangled up in such trouble.

31:26.240 --> 31:26.960
Then why would she...

31:28.030 --> 31:29.160
That's the real question.

31:31.000 --> 31:31.790
We need to figure out

31:32.880 --> 31:34.070
why she's lying.

31:36.030 --> 31:36.920
Or rather,

31:38.550 --> 31:40.000
who exactly is she trying to protect?

31:46.960 --> 31:47.270
Your Highness.

31:48.270 --> 31:48.640
Your Highness.

31:50.400 --> 31:50.750
Get out.

31:51.270 --> 31:51.640
Get out.

31:53.510 --> 31:53.960
Your Highness.

31:55.350 --> 31:55.750
I...

31:56.350 --> 31:56.830
I deserve punishment.

31:57.960 --> 31:59.640
Thank goodness you weren't hurt.

32:02.960 --> 32:04.240
I wasn't physically hurt,

32:05.160 --> 32:06.590
but I was frightened!

32:06.680 --> 32:08.030
And utterly disgusted!

32:08.640 --> 32:09.160
You...

32:09.350 --> 32:11.200
You certainly promoted
a fine subordinate!

32:12.110 --> 32:12.510
I...

32:13.000 --> 32:13.960
I deserve to die a thousand deaths!

32:37.110 --> 32:37.590
I want some tea.

32:41.480 --> 32:41.790
Yes.

32:43.440 --> 32:43.750
Right away.

33:15.790 --> 33:16.979
Hurry up!

33:17.021 --> 33:17.461
Yes.

33:23.480 --> 33:27.350
I truly misjudged the man,

33:27.830 --> 33:29.350
and you suffered because of it.

33:32.550 --> 33:34.200
Wanyao told me today

33:34.510 --> 33:35.200
that the dead man's body

33:35.750 --> 33:37.510
is still being held by the Court
of Judicial Review,

33:37.830 --> 33:38.880
while they investigate
every little thing.

33:41.070 --> 33:42.880
Princess Danyang
is very thoughtful indeed.

33:44.160 --> 33:44.640
Rest assured.

33:45.000 --> 33:46.459
I'll send someone
to the Court tomorrow...

33:46.501 --> 33:47.221
Tomorrow?

33:48.830 --> 33:49.240
Tonight!

33:50.720 --> 33:51.200
Right now!

33:51.790 --> 33:52.769
I'll send someone
to the court immediately

33:52.811 --> 33:54.051
and have that corpse brought back.

33:54.440 --> 33:55.400
Bring it back?

33:58.270 --> 33:59.160
Grind its bones to dust
and scatter the ashes?

34:00.110 --> 34:01.240
Yes! Grind its bones to dust!

34:01.550 --> 34:02.310
I promise you,

34:02.720 --> 34:03.960
this case will be closed.

34:04.160 --> 34:04.859
From now on,

34:04.901 --> 34:06.811
no one will ever mention
this matter to you again

34:07.790 --> 34:08.550
or cause you any distress.

34:14.840 --> 34:15.440
I'll be leaving, then.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.480
Leaving so soon?

34:20.360 --> 34:21.400
Lord Yu, you're a busy man.

34:22.000 --> 34:23.590
Who am I to impose on you?

34:25.280 --> 34:25.710
Your Highness,

34:26.920 --> 34:28.920
why must you speak to me like that?

34:45.230 --> 34:45.590
Oh, one more thing.

34:46.230 --> 34:47.920
The imperial exams are in a few days.

34:48.760 --> 34:50.230
Once the top three candidates
are decided,

34:50.400 --> 34:51.360
before the results are posted,

34:52.400 --> 34:53.400
I want to see the list first.

34:54.760 --> 34:57.150
Since when have you cared about
selecting officials for the court?

34:58.760 --> 35:00.360
That's hardly what interests me!

35:02.110 --> 35:03.110
Why are you following me?

35:03.440 --> 35:04.920
Go grind those bones to dust!

35:06.000 --> 35:06.400
Yes.

35:08.630 --> 35:10.070
Farewell, Your Highness!

35:52.360 --> 35:53.000
Careful, Your Highness.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.230
You should sit farther inside.

35:56.550 --> 35:57.800
We're on the grounds of my residence.

35:58.800 --> 36:01.320
I've ridden this little boat
countless times.

36:02.550 --> 36:04.840
I often take it out just
to drift around.

36:05.360 --> 36:05.960
Don't worry.

36:22.540 --> 36:29.530
♪Playing out life's game, forever by
your side; Innocent years drift by♪

36:31.260 --> 36:38.080
♪I thought time might stand still
forever at that crossroads♪

36:39.620 --> 36:46.610
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
weathering life's rise and fall♪

36:47.870 --> 36:54.820
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness
is starlight caught in your eyes♪

37:21.800 --> 37:22.190
Your Highness.

37:23.000 --> 37:23.590
Where are we?

37:24.880 --> 37:26.190
If you're going out this late,

37:26.800 --> 37:27.800
you should bring more guards.

37:28.400 --> 37:29.960
Stop worrying over nothing.

37:30.360 --> 37:31.280
There's nobody around.

38:03.000 --> 38:03.440
Not bad.

38:04.280 --> 38:05.320
It's a little small,

38:05.960 --> 38:07.320
but it's been kept quite clean.

38:09.030 --> 38:10.800
This place is connected to your
residence by waterway.

38:11.400 --> 38:12.480
Is it another of your
private properties?

38:14.000 --> 38:14.880
It used to be mine.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.760
Now it's yours.

38:18.110 --> 38:19.000
Isn't that only natural?

38:20.320 --> 38:21.110
To be frank,

38:21.440 --> 38:22.360
a residence this large

38:23.030 --> 38:24.880
requires servants
and considerable upkeep.

38:25.760 --> 38:26.480
I can't afford...

38:27.150 --> 38:27.710
Yan Shang.

38:28.230 --> 38:30.110
I've never seen anyone so poor yet
bold enough to come to the capital,

38:30.480 --> 38:31.630
and so shameless

38:31.960 --> 38:32.840
on top of that.

38:34.670 --> 38:35.360
You're too kind, Your Highness.

38:35.920 --> 38:36.510
That's easily solved.

38:37.190 --> 38:38.280
I have plenty of servants.

38:38.710 --> 38:39.710
I'll lend you a few.

38:40.880 --> 38:41.320
But...

38:42.480 --> 38:43.630
remember to write me an IOU.

38:47.960 --> 38:48.800
Anything more you want to say?

38:53.760 --> 38:54.840
Yan Shang, do you want it or not?

38:58.880 --> 38:59.630
If I say no,

39:00.030 --> 39:01.280
I'm afraid you'll slap me again.

39:01.880 --> 39:03.230
I'll speak to Wenji tomorrow

39:03.550 --> 39:04.800
and ask him to bring my belongings here.

39:05.840 --> 39:06.440
Thank you, Your Highness.

39:07.190 --> 39:09.000
I'll probably need to
borrow from you a lot.

39:09.800 --> 39:11.590
I hope you'll be generous
with the repayment deadlines.

39:13.190 --> 39:15.920
Didn't you say you had no way
to repay me?

39:17.190 --> 39:19.440
Looking you over,

39:20.550 --> 39:21.710
that mouth is your only real asset.

39:22.360 --> 39:22.840
Make sure

39:23.360 --> 39:24.360
you put it to good use.

39:40.840 --> 39:41.670
What I mean is,

39:42.400 --> 39:43.569
say more sweet things

39:43.611 --> 39:44.651
and tell interesting stories.

40:05.510 --> 40:06.630
I rarely visit this residence.

40:07.840 --> 40:08.630
Looking at it tonight,

40:09.440 --> 40:10.960
it feels so cold and desolate.

40:12.440 --> 40:13.440
If it makes you uncomfortable,

40:13.880 --> 40:14.960
I'll have someone come tomorrow

40:15.670 --> 40:16.590
to cut down all these trees

40:17.150 --> 40:17.760
and replace them with flowers.

40:18.510 --> 40:19.440
There's no need, Your Highness.

40:20.230 --> 40:21.280
I like this residence very much.

40:22.110 --> 40:23.030
Pine breezes, moonlit shadows...

40:23.480 --> 40:24.230
A sight of cool serenity.

40:25.710 --> 40:26.630
Sheng'an is such a bustling city.

40:27.440 --> 40:28.840
It's rare to find such
a peaceful retreat.

40:35.110 --> 40:35.480
Your Highness.

40:37.960 --> 40:38.320
Your Highness.

40:40.800 --> 40:43.400
The former owner of this residence
rose to the rank of chancellor,

40:44.760 --> 40:46.000
but he angered Yu Cheng'an

40:46.510 --> 40:47.000
and was eventually

40:47.880 --> 40:48.880
cut in half and left on public display.

40:51.590 --> 40:52.760
No wonder it's so chilling here.

40:53.360 --> 40:53.920
Turns out

40:54.630 --> 40:55.670
it's a haunted house.

40:59.070 --> 40:59.510
Scared?

41:02.510 --> 41:03.630
Since Lord Yu came to power,

41:04.320 --> 41:06.480
he's purged court officials
time and again.

41:07.760 --> 41:09.760
Of all the official residences
in Sheng'an,

41:10.000 --> 41:11.190
which hasn't changed hands
several times?

41:11.960 --> 41:12.510
Indeed.

41:12.920 --> 41:14.030
The highest-ranking officials,

41:14.360 --> 41:15.230
the great noble families,

41:15.760 --> 41:16.630
even members of the royal family...

41:17.320 --> 41:18.320
In Yu Cheng'an's eyes,

41:19.000 --> 41:20.280
they're nothing but meat
on a chopping block.

41:21.710 --> 41:22.320
As for me,

41:24.440 --> 41:25.320
I doubt he's even

41:25.710 --> 41:26.800
given me a second thought.

41:31.510 --> 41:32.440
What are you trying to tell me,
Your Highness?

41:35.710 --> 41:36.110
Yan Shang,

41:37.880 --> 41:39.110
I know what I want to accomplish.

41:40.760 --> 41:41.320
But...

41:42.280 --> 41:43.510
I don't know where to begin.

41:45.000 --> 41:46.070
Our strength is vastly unequal.

41:47.150 --> 41:48.920
That tiger sits high upon the mountain.

41:49.320 --> 41:50.510
I can't even get close to him.

41:51.360 --> 41:51.979
I don't want to pretend

41:52.021 --> 41:53.501
I have everything figured out
and deceive you.

41:54.800 --> 41:56.280
From now on, we stand or fall together.

41:57.320 --> 41:58.710
I owe you the truth.

42:02.480 --> 42:03.280
Thank you, Your Highness,

42:03.920 --> 42:05.070
for being honest with me.

42:07.030 --> 42:08.110
I took you on as my adviser

42:08.670 --> 42:10.550
precisely so you could give me advice.

42:14.510 --> 42:14.920
Your Highness,

42:16.480 --> 42:18.110
then let me tell you another story.

42:20.110 --> 42:20.440
All right.

42:24.340 --> 42:28.780
(Next Episode Preview)

42:29.190 --> 42:30.480
Your imperial exams are tomorrow.

42:30.800 --> 42:31.400
Are you nervous?

42:31.800 --> 42:33.150
That's not why I came here.

42:33.880 --> 42:34.880
Whether I pass or fail,

42:35.400 --> 42:35.960
it doesn't matter.

42:36.190 --> 42:37.960
Then how do you plan to make a living
in Sheng'an?

42:40.030 --> 42:42.320
By being your male favorite, of course.

42:45.280 --> 42:48.573
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

42:51.258 --> 42:56.174
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

42:58.368 --> 43:04.213
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

43:04.713 --> 43:09.939
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

43:12.708 --> 43:17.499
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

43:18.335 --> 43:24.414
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

43:26.215 --> 43:29.365
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

43:29.365 --> 43:31.013
♪Burning bright as a song♪

43:31.065 --> 43:34.789
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

43:35.167 --> 43:39.833
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

43:40.452 --> 43:44.493
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

43:44.984 --> 43:47.099
♪Not a single hour less♪

43:47.139 --> 43:54.085
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

43:54.848 --> 43:58.301
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

43:58.481 --> 44:01.626
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

44:02.065 --> 44:08.702
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

44:09.099 --> 44:11.137
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

44:11.137 --> 44:13.613
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

44:13.651 --> 44:16.120
♪You're the only one I need♪

44:16.324 --> 44:23.211
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

44:23.523 --> 44:26.794
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

44:27.099 --> 44:30.272
♪My last untouched innocence♪

44:30.596 --> 44:34.022
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

44:34.255 --> 44:37.480
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

44:37.811 --> 44:44.607
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

44:44.976 --> 44:47.038
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

44:47.039 --> 44:49.542
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

44:49.589 --> 44:51.927
♪You're the only one I need♪

44:52.158 --> 44:58.993
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

44:59.342 --> 45:00.960
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

45:01.090 --> 45:02.886
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

45:03.243 --> 45:06.260
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:06.300 --> 45:07.627
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
